1762 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Aura\nMotion Sickness Relief System  \nDesigned an AI\055powered wearable system that proactively reduces motion sickness through anticipatory sensory feedback\056  \n\042 Designed an AI wearable for proactive motion sickness relief\n\042 Designed real\055time sensing and adaptive feedback loop \240\n\042 Framed anticipatory care as a new paradigm in mobility experiences\240\n\042 Demonstrated feasibility of sensory intervention in mobility scenarios)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 1763 0 R
     /Pg 1744 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
